cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "Drone Building Scans — Commercial Building Photogrammetry Datasets"
abstract: >-
  Two complete drone photogrammetry image sets of commercial buildings in the Minneapolis
  suburbs, captured August 2026 with a DJI FC9313 at native 4096x3072 resolution. 393 images
  of a recreation center and 951 of a Border Foods restaurant site. Both flown below 16 m
  with gimbal angles spanning nadir to level, covering roof, roof edge and walls. GPS intact
  on every frame. Finished 3D models included as reference.
authors:
  - family-names: Guertin
    given-names: Matthew
    website: "https://mattguertin.com"
date-released: 2026-08-22
version: "1.0.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - photogrammetry
  - drone
  - uav
  - aerial imagery
  - 3D reconstruction
  - structure from motion
  - gaussian splatting
  - building inspection
  - roof inspection
  - dataset
